      "cml:conclusionText": "(4) A person must not:  (a) aid, abet, counsel or procure a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (b) induce, whether by threats or promises or otherwise, a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (c) be in any way, directly or indirectly, knowingly concerned in, or party to, a contravention of subsection (2) or (3); or  (d) conspire with others to effect a contravention of subsection (2) or (3).",
