    {
      "@id": "concept:telecommunications-legislation-amendment-competition-and-consumer-act-2020-sch-4-sec-100-ss-7-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates; and  (e) the person is the controller of the associated group.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must report control of local access line or telecommunications network if they have associates.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:premiseText": "(7) For the purposes of subsection (6), if:  (a) a person is in a position to exercise control of:  (i) a local access line; or  (ii) a telecommunications network; and  (b) the person has one or more associates; then:  (c) the person is taken to belong to an associated group; and  (d) the associated group consists of the person and those associates; and  (e) the person is the controller of the associated group."
    },
