      "cml:premiseText": "The information was:  Schedule 4  Funding of fixed wireless broadband and satellite broadband  Telecommunications Legislation Amendment (Competition and Consumer) Act 2020 No. 47, 2020  (i) obtained under, or for the purposes of, this Division; or  (ii) set out in a report under section 100;"
